### Phase 2 Scope

**Component Evolution (Dani)**
- Project card elevation system (hover: soft shadow + peach-cream shift + 2px Y-translate)
- Interactive filtering UI (category pills, smooth fade-in 280ms content swap)
- Case study card variant (image + headline + description with muted backdrop)
- Badge micro-components (issuer logos, verified checkmark)
- Scroll-triggered section reveals (fade-in + 12px Y-translate)

**Case Studies (5 projects, Sky + Will)**
- 3-section narrative arc: Problem → How I Built It → What Happened
- 300–500 words per project (approved length)
- Optional "Lessons" sidebar (3–5 bullet-point takeaways)
- Full OG metadata + alt text
- Linkable at `/work/[slug]/case-study`

**About Page Enhancement (Will)**
- Add "Current Focus" section (150 words, expanding on accessibility/AI/community themes)

**Performance Profiling (Peter)**
- Scroll animation impact on Core Web Vitals (LCP, CLS, FID)
- Zero regression requirement

**QA & Testing (Gary)**
- WCAG 2.2 AA validation on new interactive states
- 40/40 test suite pass before merge

